# Where the SQLite database (app.sqlite) and the log file live.
# DATA_DIR=./data
# A Postgres database instead of SQLite (Vercel: the Neon integration sets it; postgres://
# URLs work as they come).
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host/db
# Origins allowed to call the API directly. The UI goes through the Vite proxy (same origin),
# so this only matters for other clients.
# CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:5173"]
# Logging: LOG_LEVEL=INFO, LOG_FORMAT=console|json, LOG_FILE=true (false on Vercel)
#
# Not read from this file: `make dev` takes HOST (default 127.0.0.1). For online play on a
# network, run `HOST=0.0.0.0 make dev` and share http://<this machine>:5173.
